    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6779" root="جوه" body-key="j">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُوهٌ</span></b>  The <i>face,</i> or <i>countenance:</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَجْهٌ</span>; as
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جِيهٌ</span>: (Lh, K:) the latter with kesr: (TA:)
so in the saying, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَظَرَ بِجُوهِ سَوْءٍ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِجِيهِ سَوْءٍ</span> [<i>He
looked with an evil face</i> or <i>countenance</i>]. (Lh,
K.) ＝   
